### MJ MASALA API — runnable requests (IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Catalogue (public)
GET {{host}}/products?size=5&sort=popular

### Filtered shop query — mirrors the frontend filter panel
GET {{host}}/products?category=masala&maxPrice=300&minRating=4.5&sort=price-asc

### One product with its pack ladder
GET {{host}}/products/turmeric-powder

### Combos
GET {{host}}/combos

### Reviews + rating summary
GET {{host}}/products/1/reviews?sort=helpful&size=5

### Coupon preview
POST {{host}}/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "MJ10", "subtotal": 1714 }

### Pincode check
GET {{host}}/shipping/pincode/122001

### Register (returns the token pair)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Anil Dagar", "email": "anil@example.com", "phone": "9811122233", "password": "supersecret1" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anil@example.com", "password": "supersecret1" }

### Current account
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add to cart
POST {{host}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemType": "PRODUCT", "packId": 3, "quantity": 2 }

### Cart
GET {{host}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Place an order — note the server prices it, the body names SKUs only
POST {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactName": "Anil Dagar",
  "contactPhone": "9811122233",
  "contactEmail": "anil@example.com",
  "shipLine": "12 MG Road, Sector 14",
  "shipCity": "Gurugram",
  "shipState": "Haryana",
  "shipPin": "122001",
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "couponCode": "MJ10",
  "items": [ { "itemType": "PRODUCT", "packId": 3, "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### My orders
GET {{host}}/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Write a review
POST {{host}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "title": "Excellent", "body": "Deep gold colour and a strong aroma.", "city": "Gurugram" }

### Admin dashboard (needs an admin token)
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
